WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,130
what are you looking at

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,420
Check to see if there is any stock in the warehouse

3
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,120
Just took stock

4
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:13,520
outside food

5
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,020
About enough to last us 10 days

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,500
What I usually stock up on

7
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,100
Plus make up for it before leaving the city.

8
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,020
There are many more in the space

9
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:25,650
Take one step at a time

10
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,040
Maybe it will stop raining tomorrow

11
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,350
You are quite lucky

12
