13
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,240
I really can't stand it anymore

14
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,040
Then take something out and share it with everyone

15
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,780
Even the bodyguards are a little overwhelmed.

16
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,580
How can he still be so calm?

17
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:56,250
What did you think of that silk shop just now?

18
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:57,910
